      "text": "I have today designated a committee consisting of Charles Preusse, Richard C. Patterson, Jr., and Nelson Seitel, immediately to study practices in private industry and business with respect to time allowances permitted for performance of appropriate union duties by shop stewards and other union officials in their employ.",
